- `write_default_dual_config()` (line 269-297): Writes commented TOML template
- `write_dual_config()` (line 315-320): Serializes DualConfig to TOML
- `HintsError` (line 367-380): References `toml::de::Error` and `toml::ser::Error`
- Constants: `HINTS_FILENAME = ".dual.toml"` (line 36)

### Consumers of `load_hints()`
